Cewl

CeWL creates custom wordlists based on web page content.

#cewl -d 2 -m 5 -w passwords.txt http://MACHINE_IP --with-numbers
#cewl -d 0 -m 5 -w usernames.txt http://MACHINE_IP/team.php --lowercase

Wfuzz (web fuzzing tool)

#wfuzz -c -z file,usernames.txt -z file,passwords.txt --hs "Please enter the correct credentials" -u http://10.10.333.2/login.php -d "username=FUZZ&password=FUZ2Z"
